 Shiftleader Kitchen 
 Velsen-Zuid College | Bachelor | University 32 tot 38 uur €3024 - €4198 
 Velsen-Zuid 
College | Bachelor | University 
32 tot 38 uur 
Please note: Both Dutch and English speaking candidates are welcome to apply! 
As Shiftleader Kitchen, you make sure our dishes are prepared every day according to our established recipes and standards. We work with a menu dashboard containing all our recipes, and your role is to ensure that the team executes them consistently and to a high standard. 
You will also be responsible for preparing the daily hot staff meal, healthy, nutritious and with room for your own creativity within our nutritional guidelines. 
What will you do? 
❆ Lead, motivate and support the kitchen team; 
❆ Ensure that all dishes are prepared according to our recipes and presentation standards; 
❆ Prepare a healthy and nutritious staff meal every day; 
❆ Monitor hygiene, food safety and efficient working processes. 
What do you bring? 
❆ Experience in a supervisory or leadership role in a professional kitchen; 
❆ A strong eye for detail and quality, while working effectively within established processes; 
❆ Excellent organisational and coaching skills; 
❆ A hands-on, proactive and team-oriented approach; 
❆ You have a good command of Dutch and English; 
❆ You are flexible and willing to work evenings, weekends and public holidays. 
What do we offer? 
❆ A gross monthly salary between € 3,024.84 and € 4,198.66 based on a full-time position of 38 hours per week, depending on your education and experience; 
❆ Travel allowance of € 0,23 per kilometre; 
❆ Pension scheme with Zwitserleven; 
❆ 28 days of annual leave based on a full-time employment contract; 
❆ An attractive lunch arrangement and free dinner when working an evening shift; 
